:: warm
.
" $sub_np(NP) ++'s dear sibling is $value(NP) "
{ $sub_np(NP) /pres sibling $value(NP) }
:: warm
.
" $sub_np(NP) ++'s dear child is $value(NP) "
{ $sub_np(NP) /pres child $value(NP) }
:: warm
.
" $sub_np(NP) ++'s dear spouse is $value(NP) "
{ $sub_np(NP) /pres spouse $value(NP) }
:: warm
.
" $sub_np(NP) ++'s dear friend is $value(NP) "
{ $sub_np(NP) /pres friend $value(NP) }
:: warm
.

# Elaborated kinship - "esteemed" prepended, the schooled-narrator's adjective
# of choice for naming kin in the formal periphrastic register. Picked by the
