.

# --- EMOTION : JEALOUSY ---------------------------------------------------
" $sub_np(NP) is jealous of $value(NP) "
{ $sub_np(NP) /pres emotion [k jealousy ] $value(NP) } .
" $sub_np(NP) burns with jealousy over $value(NP) "
{ $sub_np(NP) /pres emotion [k jealousy ] $value(NP) }
