# --- EMOTION : CONTEMPT ---------------------------------------------------
" $sub_np(NP) holds $value(NP) in contempt "
{ $sub_np(NP) /pres emotion [k contempt ] $value(NP) } .
" $sub_np(NP) has no time at all for $value(NP) "
